          "x": 15,
          "y": 17,
          "width": 64.82291666666666,
          "height": 13.229166666666664,
          "content": "<p>OFFER LETTER</p>",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 22,
            "color": "#111827",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif",
            "fontWeight": "bold"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "32b90b77-3bc7-46f2-8a46-079d08e64829",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 15,
          "y": 102.43750000000003,
          "width": 179.91666666666666,
          "height": 182.56249999999997,
          "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Dear </span>{{recName}},</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">On behalf of Acme Corporation, I am delighted to extend this offer for the position of </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">{{offeredRole}}</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> Your experience and technical expertise make you an excellent fit for our team.</span></p><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 12px;\">Compensation Package</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Your annual base salary will be </span><strong style=\"font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">{{currency}}{{salary}}</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">, paid bi-weekly. You will also be eligible for a performance bonus of up to </span><strong style=\"font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">15%</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> of your base salary, payable annually based on company and individual performance metrics.</span></p><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Equity Grant</strong></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Subject to Board approval, you will receive a stock option grant of </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">15,000 shares</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> vesting over four years with a one-year cliff, at the fair market value on your start date.</span></p><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 12px;\">Benefits Overview</strong></h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Comprehensive health, dental, and vision insurance</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">401(k) plan with 4% company match</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">15 days paid time off plus company holidays</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Professional development budget of $2,500 annually</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Home office setup allowance of $1,000</span></li></ol><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">Next Steps</strong></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Please review the attached employment agreement and return a signed copy by </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">July 30, 2026</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">. Your start date is confirmed for </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">August 15, 2026</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We are excited to welcome you to the team!</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Best regards,</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">{{senderName}}</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">{{senderRole}}</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">{{companyName}}</span></p>",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 10,
            "color": "#374151",
            "textAlign": "justify",
            "fontFamily": "Arial, Sans serif"
          }
        },
